### 列表查询 price_pull_target
GET http://localhost:8080/api/price-pull-targets?providerConfigId=1&enabled=true&q=BTC&limit=50

### 按ID查询
GET http://localhost:8080/api/price-pull-targets/1

### 新增
POST http://localhost:8080/api/price-pull-targets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetId": 1,
  "providerConfigId": 1,
  "instType": "SPOT",
  "instId": "BTC-USDT",
  "quoteSymbol": "USDT",
  "enabled": true,
  "pollIntervalMs": 1000,
  "priority": 1
}

### 修改
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/price-pull-targets/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetId": 1,
  "providerConfigId": 1,
  "instType": "SPOT",
  "instId": "ETH-USDT",
  "quoteSymbol": "USDT",
  "enabled": true,
  "pollIntervalMs": 1500,
  "priority": 2
}

### 删除
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/price-pull-targets/1
### 启用
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/price-pull-targets/1/enable

### 停用
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/price-pull-targets/1/disable